            <div class="flex">
                <div data-testid="long-bio" class="author-long-bio text-body-2 !w-full !text-d3"><p>Gilbert McGregor first joined The Sporting News in 2018 as a content producer for Global editions of NBA.com. Before covering the game, McGregor played basketball collegiately at Wake Forest, graduating with a Communication degree in 2016. McGregor began covering the NBA during the 2017-18 season and has been on hand for a number of league events.</p></div>

